    "Titles": {
        "eng": "One ~To the Radiant Season~",
        "jpn": "ONE～輝く季節へ～"
    },
    "Summaries": {
        "eng": "Orihara Kouhei returns to his town after a long disappearance to fullfil the promises he made to several girls in his childhood. He suffered from memory loss, and carries a tragic past. An strange ambient sorrounds the OVA...It's almost like a dream, like memories from the past trying to come toghether in one piece but without being able to...",
        "jpn": "高校2年の少年、折原浩平は幼馴染の長森瑞佳をはじめ、里村茜、七瀬留美、川名みさき、上月澪といった少女たちと出会い、約束をする。そして浩平は「えいえんの世界」に旅立ち、彼女たちや周りの人から忘れられていく。浩平は、果たして「えいえんの世界」から戻ってくるのか…。"
    },
    "Aliases": [
        "Kagayaku Kisetsu e",
        "ONE ~to a shining season~"
    ],
